This distribution extracts the headless driver from OrcaSQL Workbench.
The standalone interface, error/logging names, connection options, package
metadata, documentation, tooling, and additional interface tests are maintained
in ArkDB. The protocol behavior and its upstream-derived fixtures are retained.

Portions of the MySQL protocol/authentication implementation and fixtures
are adapted from the following MIT-licensed projects. These notices apply
to those portions and do not modify their original license terms.

